{"3634430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BAZOOKA: Rhythm Game","steam_appid":3634430,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ARE YOU IN THE MOOD FOR HITTING MANY MANY ARROWS?<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/04fbeb33f3354f673b3c37fc778d9794.poster.avif?t=1782443768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/04fbeb33f3354f673b3c37fc778d9794.webm?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/04fbeb33f3354f673b3c37fc778d9794.mp4?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a glance at BAZOOKA: Rhythm Game! But beware; It shines so hard (metaphorically) that it could hurt your metaphorical eyes if you have that kind of thing. A Classic four-lane rhythm game with original sound track and music videos.<br><br> Embark in a long-lasting and ongoing adventure with Codrin and ECHO (that's us, that's BAZOOKA) and master our songs in 3 difficulties: Baby Mode (👶), Canon and Hell Mode! Discover the points shop to unlock new songs\/backgrounds and more features!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've been making music for 11 years now (yes, I know we could be better after all that time) and we are heading towards releasing our 7th album (all our music from now on will be updated into the game if we don't suddenly die or something weird like that).<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > LOOK AT THESE WONDERFUL MEDALS<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/b2515907df3f810150c259a79792051c.poster.avif?t=1782443768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/b2515907df3f810150c259a79792051c.webm?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/b2515907df3f810150c259a79792051c.mp4?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on other nerds climbing the leaderboards and prove that your eye-finger-ear coordination is superior because if no one is inferior to you, are you the worst human on the whole planet? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before this project, I was a long time fan of many rhythm games so this is like a dream that came true for me, to have our own game with our own music. I almost wanted to scream &quot;IT'S ALIVE&quot; once it was done but I just recently finished reading the original Frankenstein and no one actually screamed that shit in the whole book, WTF?  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Take the advice from the person that directly benefits from you buying the game and buy the game today!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK! EVEN MORE ARROWS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/1f39bf547123e8ffaba0c7dbdeae33f4.poster.avif?t=1782443768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/1f39bf547123e8ffaba0c7dbdeae33f4.webm?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/1f39bf547123e8ffaba0c7dbdeae33f4.mp4?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was made primarily for our romanian audience but we welcome wholeheartedly each and every person around the globe who would like to give it a try! <br>I CONJURE YOU ALL to experience our game.<br>xoxo my bois and grills<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ARE YOU IN THE MOOD FOR HITTING MANY MANY ARROWS?<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/04fbeb33f3354f673b3c37fc778d9794.poster.avif?t=1782443768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/04fbeb33f3354f673b3c37fc778d9794.webm?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/04fbeb33f3354f673b3c37fc778d9794.mp4?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a glance at BAZOOKA: Rhythm Game! But beware; It shines so hard (metaphorically) that it could hurt your metaphorical eyes if you have that kind of thing. A Classic four-lane rhythm game with original sound track and music videos.<br><br> Embark in a long-lasting and ongoing adventure with Codrin and ECHO (that's us, that's BAZOOKA) and master our songs in 3 difficulties: Baby Mode (👶), Canon and Hell Mode! Discover the points shop to unlock new songs\/backgrounds and more features!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've been making music for 11 years now (yes, I know we could be better after all that time) and we are heading towards releasing our 7th album (all our music from now on will be updated into the game if we don't suddenly die or something weird like that).<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > LOOK AT THESE WONDERFUL MEDALS<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/b2515907df3f810150c259a79792051c.poster.avif?t=1782443768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/b2515907df3f810150c259a79792051c.webm?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/b2515907df3f810150c259a79792051c.mp4?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on other nerds climbing the leaderboards and prove that your eye-finger-ear coordination is superior because if no one is inferior to you, are you the worst human on the whole planet? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before this project, I was a long time fan of many rhythm games so this is like a dream that came true for me, to have our own game with our own music. I almost wanted to scream &quot;IT'S ALIVE&quot; once it was done but I just recently finished reading the original Frankenstein and no one actually screamed that shit in the whole book, WTF?  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Take the advice from the person that directly benefits from you buying the game and buy the game today!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK! EVEN MORE ARROWS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/1f39bf547123e8ffaba0c7dbdeae33f4.poster.avif?t=1782443768\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/1f39bf547123e8ffaba0c7dbdeae33f4.webm?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/extras\/1f39bf547123e8ffaba0c7dbdeae33f4.mp4?t=1782443768\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was made primarily for our romanian audience but we welcome wholeheartedly each and every person around the globe who would like to give it a try! <br>I CONJURE YOU ALL to experience our game.<br>xoxo my bois and grills<\/p>","short_description":"Hear that thunder? Neither do I 'cause it's THE SUNNIEST DAY OF THEM ALL! Romania's most chaotic and unpredictable hip-hop duo has FINALLY released their passion project. Master the rhythm, unlock medals, and crush the leaderboards across 29+ (and more incoming) tracks. GET IN THERE ALREADY!","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Romanian<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/09a88232fb212807f687ae9481db88d955a3cc11\/header.jpg?t=1782443768","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/efe320812eac74394b332dfb7297e3e288c27fbe\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782443768","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3634430\/efe320812eac74394b332dfb7297e3e288c27fbe\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782443768","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86-64 CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> anything with Vulkan or DX11 <br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<s